SUMMARY:Morning Hike at White Pines
DESCRIPTION:Join TLC for a beautiful morning at White Pines!\nTLC Trail Guide Cara C. will guide you along the River\, White Pines\, and Deep Bluffs trails for a 3-mile hike under the pines! This will be a moderate hike with variable topographic change so please wear comfortable walking shoes and bring hiking poles and binoculars if you have them. This is a free event\, but preregistration is required.\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\nIf registration is full\, please fill out the waitlist form here by October 22nd at noon.
URL:https://triangleland.org/event/morning-hike-at-white-pines-2
LOCATION:White Pines Nature Preserve\, 548 S Rocky River Rd\, Sanford\, NC\, 27330\, United States
ORGANIZER;CN="Amaya Horner":MAILTO:ahorner@triangleland.org
END:VEVENT
